    <releases>
        <release date="2025-10-02" version="2.1.1">Expansion Pack for 3-Phase 3-Level Vienna rectifier PFC Application

The package works only with .ioc projects generated by eDesign-Suite Digital Power Workbench 3-Level T-type Bidirectional Converter web solution.

The URL to access eDesignSuite Digital Power Workbench is https://eds.st.com/eds-console/#/digital-power-workbench 

To start directly a 3-Level T-type Bidirectional Converter design use 

https://eds.st.com/vienna-bidir/?msg={"data":{"application":"vienna-bidir_html","specs":{"ic":"stm32g474retx:vienna-bidir","input":{"v":{"min":185,"max":265},"f":50},"output":[{"v":800,"p":15000}]}},"action":"new_design"}

Generated with STM32PackCreator 4.0.0</release>
        <release date="2025-08-08" version="2.1.0">This package version is compatible with STM32CubeMX 6.14.0
It was generated with STM32PackCreator 4.1.0</release>
